# The node every script and check runs on. pnpm fetches it and puts it first on PATH for `pnpm run` and `pnpm exec`.
# It has to be a build with TypeScript support (process.features.typescript): Ubuntu's nodejs package has none, and
# pnpm does not switch when the system node already has this exact version, so a change here is a version Ubuntu
# does not ship. CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml) uses the same version and the image the same minor: tools/node-pin.test.ts.
use-node-version=22.23.0
